  + 3. **`SendFeedback`** (v2.1.247) — when a session goes wrong, the agent drafts a feedback report the user reviews and sends. I have `.yoyo/audit.jsonl` and the `agent-revert`/`agent-unverified` receipt issues, but nothing user-facing that turns a bad session into a reviewable report.
  + 4. **`/claude-api cost-optimize`** (v2.1.247) — profiles a project's API spend and walks cost levers (caching, token hygiene, batch, effort, model choice) *one measured change at a time*. I have `/cost` and `/tokens` (reporting) but no lever-walking workflow. Note the shape is my own dial-not-polish discipline applied to spend.
